From 1ade020096a4890775ec6113b3e0768bf9dc9380 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:38:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Compact routed requests before context attestations
 reject them

Treat only otherwise eligible request-size refusals as bounded context overflow; retain billing, funding, mixed-capability and irreducible-budget refusals. Align proactive compression with the route validator estimator and output runway; use attested auxiliary class windows without probing selectors.

Proof: parent turn-loop RED required=276008 attested=272000 (2 failures, 6 policy controls pass). Focused GREEN 24 tests; related compression/routing/autoraise suite 1081 passed before final control additions. Sixteen exact-anchor mutants killed. Ordinary Codex .50-to-.85 autoraise with a true 272k window was already safe; estimator divergence is independently covered. Worker deployment and post-deploy live threshold crossing remain to be verified by the owner card.
